{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?_eq_invModImpl\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">invMod?_eq_invModImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?\">invMod?</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invModImpl\">invModImpl</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?_eq_invModImpl","kind":"theorem","line":423,"name":"UInt64.invMod?_eq_invModImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L423-L427"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powMod_eq_powModImpl\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">powMod_eq_powModImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powMod\">powMod</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModImpl\">powModImpl</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powMod_eq_powModImpl","kind":"theorem","line":387,"name":"UInt64.powMod_eq_powModImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L387-L397"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invModImpl.go\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">invModImpl</span>.<span class=\"name\">go</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">modulus </span><span class=\"fn\">oldR </span><span class=\"fn\">r </span><span class=\"fn\">oldS </span><span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invModImpl.go","kind":"def","line":298,"name":"UInt64.invModImpl.go","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L298-L304"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invModImpl\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">invModImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Efficient implementation of `UInt64.invMod?`, using a word-sized extended Euclidean loop.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invModImpl","kind":"def","line":294,"name":"UInt64.invModImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L294-L307"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModImpl.go\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">powModImpl</span>.<span class=\"name\">go</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">modulus </span><span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">exponent</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">result</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModImpl.go","kind":"def","line":286,"name":"UInt64.powModImpl.go","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L286-L290"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModImpl\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">powModImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">exponent</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Efficient implementation of `UInt64.powMod`. A `Nat` exponent is consumed 64 bits at a time, so\narbitrarily large exponents only pay for one `Nat` division per word rather than per bit.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModImpl","kind":"def","line":279,"name":"UInt64.powModImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L279-L292"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModChunk\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">powModChunk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Performs `steps` squaring steps, consuming that many bits of `exponent`. Returns the repeatedly\nsquared base alongside the accumulated result. Neither is reduced modulo `modulus` unless a step\nruns, so `steps = 0` returns both arguments unchanged and the accumulator passed in must already\nbe reduced.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModChunk","kind":"def","line":267,"name":"UInt64.powModChunk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L267-L277"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModWord\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">powModWord</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base </span><span class=\"fn\">exponent </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus </span><span class=\"fn\">result</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Multiplies `result` by `base ^ exponent` modulo `modulus`, consuming the bits of the word-sized\n`exponent` from the least significant end. `result` is returned unchanged when `exponent` is `0`,\nso the accumulator passed in must already be reduced modulo `modulus`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powModWord","kind":"def","line":251,"name":"UInt64.powModWord","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L251-L265"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?_eq_some_iff\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">invMod?_eq_some_iff</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus </span><span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?\">invMod?</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option.some\">some</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Iff\">↔</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.mulMod\">mulMod</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`invMod?` returns exactly the reduced multiplicative inverse. The bound `x < modulus` is needed:\nwithout it the equation alone would also admit representatives shifted by `modulus`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?_eq_some_iff","kind":"theorem","line":225,"name":"UInt64.invMod?_eq_some_iff","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L225-L240"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.mulMod_of_invMod?_eq_some\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">mulMod_of_invMod?_eq_some</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus </span><span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?\">invMod?</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option.some\">some</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.mulMod\">mulMod</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value returned by `invMod?` really is a multiplicative inverse. Note that for `modulus = 1` the\nright-hand side is `0`, matching the convention that everything is invertible modulo one.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.mulMod_of_invMod?_eq_some","kind":"theorem","line":199,"name":"UInt64.mulMod_of_invMod?_eq_some","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L199-L208"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.lt_of_invMod?_eq_some\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">lt_of_invMod?_eq_some</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus </span><span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?\">invMod?</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option.some\">some</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.lt_of_invMod?_eq_some","kind":"theorem","line":193,"name":"UInt64.lt_of_invMod?_eq_some","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L193-L197"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.isSome_invMod?\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">isSome_invMod?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hm</span> : <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Ne\">≠</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?\">invMod?</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">modulus</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Option/Basic.html#Option.isSome\">isSome</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Iff\">↔</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/Gcd.html#Nat.gcd\">gcd</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">modulus</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.isSome_invMod?","kind":"theorem","line":178,"name":"UInt64.isSome_invMod?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L178-L180"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\