">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?.go","kind":"def","line":48,"name":"UInt64.invMod?.go","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L48-L55"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">invMod?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the multiplicative inverse of `a` modulo `modulus`, or `none` if the inverse does not\nexist. When `modulus` is `0`, the result is `none`. For a nonzero modulus, an inverse exists exactly\nwhen `a` and `modulus` are coprime.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.invMod?","kind":"def","line":39,"name":"UInt64.invMod?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L39-L59"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powMod\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">powMod</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">exponent</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Raises a 64-bit unsigned integer to a natural-number power modulo `modulus`. When `modulus` is `0`,\nthe result is the wrapped power.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.powMod","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"UInt64.powMod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L32-L37"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.mulMod\"><span class=\"name\">UInt64</span>.<span class=\"name\">mulMod</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b </span><span class=\"fn\">modulus</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Multiplies two 64-bit unsigned integers and reduces the result modulo `modulus` without losing the\nhigh half of the product. When `modulus` is `0`, the result is the wrapped product.\n\nThis function is overridden at runtime with an efficient implementation.","docLink":"./Init/Data/UInt/Modular.html#UInt64.mulMod","kind":"def","line":22,"name":"UInt64.mulMod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/UInt/Modular.lean#L22-L30"}}],"imports":["Init.ByCases","Init.Data.Nat.Gcd","Init.Data.Nat.Lemmas","Init.Data.Nat.Mod","Init.Data.UInt.Basic","Init.Data.UInt.Lemmas","Init.Omega","Init.WFTactics"],"instances":[],"name":"Init.Data.UInt.Modular"}